 "b7bb0d379c618ac56049bcb501f1a4ccea7f0e7b", "message": "functionality to change tooltip content while the tooltip is currently open\n\nRunning $(element).data('tooltipsterContent', myNewContent) will now\nupdate the content of an open tooltip. The variable 'element' in this\ncase does not equal the tooltip itself - but the element that the\ntooltip originated from.", "created_at": "2013-01-31T01:01:52Z", "repo": "tooltipster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "df9ce7ec6ec8eb81acfa54eaabc60e672099a385", "message": "Merge branch 'dev'", "created_at": "2013-01-30T23:40:13Z", "repo": "tooltipster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7cd13f2b693617ac09f887e11591152d9c31f024", "message": "fixed addEventListener() error in IE8", "created_at": "2013-01-30T23:39:53Z", "repo": "tooltipster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7873bb79138551e16231c8175c36ea826cecf504", "message": "Merge branch 'dev'", "created_at": "2013-01-25T19:54:30Z", "repo": "tooltipster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0e95551f5a019bf759253834ee2b7e9bbe5f7bc1", "message": "refining logic that will make sure tooltips don't go off the top of your screen and testing Masonry with Tooltipster", "created_at": "2013-01-25T19:54:02Z", "repo": "tooltipster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8602086ca7b393ad9bc5e681410bc26b1252745a", "message": "Merge branch 'dev'", "created_at": "2013-01-24T21:40:07Z", "repo": "tooltipster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "37f2f9db1cf9a9a2f556f39f3d80fa166f11118f", "message": "tooltips will now close on device orientation change", "created_at": "2013-01-24T20:58:24Z", "repo": "tooltipster", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "08820a69f65f2cabb1340fc7efe1c6253c40fd23",